# 必考词 Unit 30 短语

## 常考短语

- **discriminate against**: 歧视 — It is illegal to discriminate against anyone based on race. 基于种族歧视任何人是非法的。
- **dismiss sb from**: 解雇某人 — He was dismissed from his position. 他被解除了职务。
- **on display**: 展出 — The new collection is on display at the gallery. 新系列在画廊展出。
- **beyond dispute**: 无可争辩 — His talent is beyond dispute. 他的才华无可争辩。
- **a distinct difference**: 明显的区别 — There is a distinct difference between the two. 两者之间有明显的区别。
- **distribute...to**: 把…分配给 — The funds were distributed to the research teams. 资金被分配给了研究团队。
- **a diverse range of**: 各种各样的 — The store offers a diverse range of products. 商店提供各种各样的产品。
- **domestic affairs**: 国内事务 — The president focused on domestic affairs. 总统专注于国内事务。
- **a dramatic increase**: 急剧增长 — There has been a dramatic increase in prices. 物价出现了急剧增长。
- **elaborate on**: 详细阐述 — Please elaborate on your findings. 请详细阐述你的发现。
- **eliminate the risk of**: 消除…的风险 — We must eliminate the risk of failure. 我们必须消除失败的风险。
- **embrace change**: 拥抱变化 — Successful organizations embrace change. 成功的组织拥抱变化。
- **emerging markets**: 新兴市场 — The company is expanding into emerging markets. 公司正在向新兴市场扩展。
- **enable sb to do sth**: 使某人能够做某事 — Technology enables us to work from home. 技术使我们能够在家工作。
- **enforce the law**: 执法 — The police are responsible for enforcing the law. 警方负责执法。
